# Cross-Harness Conformance reports are generated (timestamped); run
# `npm run bench:conformance` to reproduce. The committed evidence is the
# command + its documented result in README, not a frozen timestamped file.
benchmarks/reports/conformance/

# Mission 控制面（personal-dev-workflow：RUN_STATE 与 Mission 证据/卡，绝不提交）
RUN_STATE.md
.dsh-mission/

# personal-dev-workflow v1.0.0：机器真相源（运行时状态，每次计数都变）
.agent-state/

# 历史验证证据要入版本库（审计可翻），故对 evidence/ 放宽上面的 *.log 规则。
# 仅此目录例外，不影响仓库其余位置的日志忽略。
!evidence/**/*.log
# Mission 冻结状态档案同样要入版本库（即 evidence/missions/mission-0X/RUN_STATE.md）；
# 上面那条 RUN_STATE.md 规则本意是忽略"运行时状态"，不应连带忽略已冻结的历史档案。
!evidence/missions/mission-*/RUN_STATE.md

